From 4d13baca785067ecfe054ff4f8641d1096d657d1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 14:11:09 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] ADD review completion confirmation so clean patch agents
 close only after approval

Clean automatic reviews append a confirmation prompt to the reviewed patch-agent chat and emit a fresh selection event for every clean review pass. The terminal treats yes/no as completion control instead of agent input, so approved chats can be hidden while later follow-up typing reopens the patch-agent chat.
